# Well known servers, always written first and never dropped by ranking.
# A dead anchor fails the generator, because an anchor is meant to be stable.
#
# ghcr.mirror.archlinux.pkgforge.dev is the GHCR mirror of this port,
# pkgforge-dev/mirror-archlinux. It serves upstream's own databases and package
# files from GitHub's package storage, through a redirect. It is first, so the
# build and a consumer read it first, and pacman falls through to the next
# Server when a transfer from it fails.
#
# ⚠ It follows upstream on a schedule of its own, every three hours. The build
# compares it with the next server before it reads it, and builds without it
# when it is behind: scripts/check-mirror-lag.
#
# ⚠ It cannot forge a package. SigLevel stays Required, and every package
# carries upstream's own signature.
Server = https://ghcr.mirror.archlinux.pkgforge.dev/$arch/$repo
#
# geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com is Arch's own GeoIP balanced endpoint.
Server = https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/$repo/os/$arch
